Dual-repo follow-on to pi-c2c I001. Add a sibling c2c oc-plugin multi-key JSONL sink so one parent-owned process can atomically maintain existing per-instance statefiles. Preserve the one-key command and raw c2c statefile --instance compatibility. Validate every per-line instance key as a safe single path component; retain complete-snapshot semantics. Ingest into a concrete phase/task hierarchy, then coordinate implementation and cross-review with pi-c2c over c2c.